SDK codegen: indexed lookups in two quadratic loops (release build-speed work, docs/release-app.md "Build time").
FunctionGraph::notifyFunctionAdded tried every function against each new one; it now visits only the functions
that recorded an unresolved jump to the new base. cleanupAbsorbedGapFills tested every function against every
GAP_FILL entry; it now walks a base-sorted interval index. Both give exactly the same graph: rexglue codegen output
is byte-identical (591 files), 24.6 s -> 5.4 s on an M5 Max. Applied by tools/build_sdk_from_source.py.

